<%- include('../common-new/header') %>

    <body>

        <%- include('../common-new/navbar') %>

            <section class="hero-section pb-5 new-header-padding-sec">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="row flex-lg-row-reverse align-items-center g-4">
                        <div class="col-lg-6">
                            <img src="https://assets.clarisco.com/clarisco-images/webapps/iot/iot-development-company.webp"
                                alt="iot-development-company" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-lg-6">

                            <h1 class="display-7 fw-bold lh-1 my-3"> Blockchain<span class="fc-b"> IoT</span>
                                Development Company
                            </h1>
                            <p>Internet of Things integrated with Blockchain to provide better
                                solutions for any
                                problem
                                you may be faced with.</p>
                            <div class="d-grid gap-2 d-md-flex justify-content-md-start">
                                <button data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#PopForm"
                                    class="nft-new-banner-button-1">Get a Demo</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="border-bottom-new-design py-5">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="row align-items-center g-4">
                        <div class="col-lg-6">
                            <img src="https://assets.clarisco.com/clarisco-images/webapps/iot/blockchain-iot-company-1.webp"
                                alt="blockchainiotdevelopment" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-lg-6">
                            <h2 class="mb-4">Blockchain is the Future of IoT</h2>
                            <p>Clarisco Solution is now active in the Internet of Things (IoT)
                                field. The IoT has
                                made a
                                significant impact on distributed ledger technology and blockchain technology. We
                                strive
                                to create the perfect distributed network of devices using IoT solutions. IoT
                                solutions
                                can be used to provide interoperability solutions to Blockchains, ledgers and
                                exchanges.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="py-5 border-bottom-new-design">
                <div class="container">
                    <h2 class="text-center mb-5">The steps involved in Blockchain IoT</h2>
                    <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-lg-3 g-4">
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                                    <h6 class="card-title mt-2 fw-bold">Identify the problem and define it</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text">IoT is about finding solutions to problems
                                        that are posed
                                        by blockchain technology. First, identify the problem and determine its
                                        extent.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                                    <h6 class="card-title mt-2 fw-bold">Fabricate Solution</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text">Once the problem is defined, solutions can be
                                        found and
                                        used to arrive at a solution.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                                    <h6 class="card-title mt-2 fw-bold">Get the Solution to create an app</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text">Make an app or other asset to test the
                                        solution.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                                    <h6 class="card-title mt-2 fw-bold">Use the app</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text">Once the asset or app is created, you can use
                                        it to solve
                                        the problem.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                                    <h6 class="card-title mt-2 fw-bold">Help and Improvement</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text">Users are enjoying the results of the app or
                                        asset running
                                        smoothly without any problems. Continuous support is provided to improve the
                                        asset or app.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="py-5 border-bottom-new-design">
                <div class="container">
                    <h2 class="text-center mb-3">Solutions</h2>
                    <p class="text-center mb-5">Some of the solutions offered by Blockchain IoT are as
                        follows,</p>
                    <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-lg-4 g-4">
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                                    <h6 class="card-title mt-2 fw-bold">Decentralization</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text">Reduce transaction fees and eliminate
                                        peer-to-peer
                                        requirements in blockchains</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                                    <h6 class="card-title mt-2 fw-bold">Blockless distributed ledger</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text">You can identify and approve transactions in
                                        the
                                        distributed ledger, without using the blockchain.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                                    <h6 class="card-title mt-2 fw-bold">Blockchain as a Service (BaaS).</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text">Cloud services can be integrated with
                                        Blockchain to quickly
                                        deploy projects.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                                    <h6 class="card-title mt-2 fw-bold">Private entities and shared devices</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text">You can share wireless devices that are
                                        connected to IoT or
                                        you can buy private entities using Blockchain-connected IoT solutions.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="py-5 border-bottom-new-design">
                <div class="container">
                    <h2 class="text-center mb-3">Our IoT Technology Expertise</h2>
                    <p class="text-center mb-5">Our IoT development team has in-depth knowledge of
                        following IoT
                        platforms and Protocols.</p>
                    <ul class="nav nav-pills mb-3 d-flex justify-content-center mx-auto" id="pills-tab" role="tablist">
                        <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                            <button class="nav-link text-white active" id="pills-1-tab" data-bs-toggle="pill"
                                data-bs-target="#pills-1" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="pills-1"
                                aria-selected="true">IoT Platforms</button>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                            <button class="nav-link text-white" id="pills-2-tab" data-bs-toggle="pill"
                                data-bs-target="#pills-2" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="pills-2"
                                aria-selected="false">Connectivity</button>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                            <button class="nav-link text-white" id="pills-3-tab" data-bs-toggle="pill"
                                data-bs-target="#pills-3" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="pills-3"
                                aria-selected="false">Hardware &
                                Sensor</button>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                            <button class="nav-link text-white" id="pills-4-tab" data-bs-toggle="pill"
                                data-bs-target="#pills-4" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="pills-4"
                                aria-selected="false">Protocol &
                                Standards</button>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="tab-content mt-5 d-flex justify-content-center" id="pills-tabContent">
                        <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="pills-1" role="tabpanel"
                            aria-labelledby="pills-1-tab">
                            <div class="container">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-lg-12  mx-auto">
                                        <ul class="list-group">
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">Azure IoT Hub</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black"> AWS IoT hub</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">Google Cloud</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">ThingWorx</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">Predix</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="pills-2-tab">
                            <div class="container">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-lg-12 mx-auto">
                                        <ul class="list-group">
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">Bluetooth</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">ZigBee</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black"> Sigfox</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black"> Wi-Fi</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">LAN</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">NFC</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">RFID</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">Ethernet</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="pills-3-tab">
                            <div class="container">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-lg-12 mx-auto">
                                        <ul class="list-group">
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">Arduino</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">iBeacons</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">Raspberry Pi</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">Eddystone beacons</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">OBD devices</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">Miniature Boards</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-4" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="pills-4-tab">
                            <div class="container">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-lg-12 mx-auto">
                                        <ul class="list-group">
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">HTTP/HTTPS</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">LoRaWAN</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">TCP</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">BLE</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">MQTT</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">DDS</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">AMQP</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">Homekit</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">OpenIoT</li>
                                            <li class="list-group-item bg-black">Nest</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="py-5 border-bottom-new-design">
                <div class="container">
                    <h2 class="text-center mb-5">FAQ(Frequently Asked Question)</h2>
                    <div class="accordion" id="accordionExample">
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingOne">
                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                                    What is custom IoT development?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne"
                                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    IoT Development is the process of creating IoT products and applications that
                                    can be
                                    controlled remotely. These connected products can monitor their environment and
                                    condition via sensors or external data sources. IoT development is customized to
                                    fit
                                    the needs of a company. </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                                    What's the purpose of IoT?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo"
                                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    The Internet of things aims to create devices that can self-report in real-time,
                                    increasing efficiency, and bringing more important information to the surface
                                    faster
                                    than systems that rely on human intervention.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                                    How does the Internet of Things work?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree"
                                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    An IoT system is made up of devices and sensors that "talk" with the cloud via
                                    some
                                    type of connectivity. Software processes the data once it reaches the cloud and
                                    may
                                    decide to take any action without the user's involvement, such as automatically
                                    adjusting sensors/devices or sending out alerts.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFour">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">
                                    Is IoT possible without the Internet?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour"
                                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    Although the Internet is the name of the Internet of Things, it doesn't
                                    necessarily
                                    need it. Think of IoT instead as things that use the same technology that the
                                    Internet does. Even without the Internet, IoT can be valuable.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFive">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">
                                    IoT is most commonly used where?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFive"
                                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    IoT is most prevalent in transportation, manufacturing and utility
                                    organizations.
                                    However, there are also use cases for IoT within the agriculture,
                                    infrastructure,
                                    and home automation industries. This has led some organizations to digital
                                    transformation.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <%- include('../common-new/footer') %>

    </body>

    </html>